Like how about like, if you didn't come in with enough force on the ramp, you just fall

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:12.640
in the hole. Right. Yeah. Why should it, why should it automatically like fling you into the air on the topic of

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:16.540
tricks? I don't know if that many tricks on skateboards were invented.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:23.860
Well, that's not true, but I also, I mean, yeah, but even so, I think what I meant by

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:30.220
