life consequences.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:59.240
And I know we can't like expect them to program crazy, crazy tricks into it, but I just think

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:03.680
that it's, it's not as satisfying to be the point rack up thing and not have enough going

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:05.200
on to give you those points.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:09.000
But why can't we expect crazy things in this game when you're playing as a gorilla?

