00:19:12.740 --> 00:19:14.540
Yeah. It's like a, like a shortcut there.

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:19.380
Right. It seems like they were just like, well, the hitbox of the character has turned, has touched

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:21.800
the, but then why wouldn't that happen with pitfalls?

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:28.160
I mean, cause they, they already have established that your way of tracking your Z axis is looking

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:31.340
at the shadow. So they, they know how to do that.

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:33.380
Yeah. And the shadow, the shadow is great.

